    "description": "# BA-7: Role & Status Change Log Related List\n\n_Give Ops a read-only audit trail of every BA Status and Team Role change, right on the record._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: Changed, Field, From, To, Reason, Changed By\n\n* System-written, read-only — no manual create/edit; populated exclusively by the Status Change Logging automation (BA-6)\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript — sourced from the prototype only\n\n* Must exist before [BUILD-207 — Brand Ambassador: Status Change Logging](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693595168230/f/) (BA-6) can write to it\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-7 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n* Related list only — no standalone object beyond what BA-6's automation needs to write these rows.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-7 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-207 — Brand Ambassador: Status Change Logging](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693595168230/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
